<title>RUSSIA: Russia PM says financial policies to be unchanged.</title>
<headline>Russia PM says financial policies to be unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's forthcoming cabinet reshuffle will not influence government policies on the financial markets, Prime Minister Viktor Chernomyrdin told Itar-Tass news agency on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He said lowering yields for government securities would continue to be the main priority to attract capital into the industry and to revive investment.</p>
</text>
